---
// Step 2: a dot carries the layout from the Marketplace tile into your own project.
---

<div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center gap-3 px-6">
  <div class="ill-tile w-[34%] p-3">
    <div class="ill-line w-3/5"></div>
    <div class="ill-line mt-2 w-full"></div>
    <div class="ill-block mt-3 aspect-[4/3]"></div>
  </div>
  <span class="relative h-3 w-8 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="ill-dot absolute left-1/2 top-0 size-3 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>
  </span>
  <div class="ill-tile ill-tile-accent w-[34%] p-3">
    <div class="ill-line ill-line-accent ill-fill w-3/5"></div>
    <div class="ill-line ill-line-accent ill-fill mt-2 w-full" style="animation-delay: 0.15s"></div>
    <div class="ill-block ill-block-accent ill-fill mt-3 aspect-[4/3]" style="animation-delay: 0.3s"></div>
  </div>
</div>
